'''Seals''' are passive creatures found on the shores and [[Abandoned Village|Abandoned Villages]] of the [[Deep North]]. They come in 0, 1 and 2-star variants.

'''Baby Seals''' are seal pups. They spawn on the same shorelines as adult seals, in groups of one to three, and never have stars.

Neither Seals nor Baby Seals have any attacks.

